flowchart LR
    USER[用户] --> CLI[bugx CLI<br/>安装 · 配置 · 诊断]
    CLI --> HOST[AI 宿主<br/>OpenCode · Codex · Claude · Pi · ChatGPT]
    HOST --> PROTOCOL[BugX Agent / Skill<br/>审计协议]

    subgraph BUGX[BugX 协议面]
        SUP[状态与结算监督]
        LIFE[Session / Round / Life]
        COVER[覆盖与证据门禁]
    end

    subgraph HOST_EXEC[AI 宿主执行面]
        ORCHESTRATOR[宿主原生编排<br/>串行 · 并发 · 子 Agent（可选）]
        TASKS[测试任务]
        TARGET[被测应用或代码库]
        EVIDENCE[结构化证据]
    end

    PROTOCOL --> SUP
    SUP --> LIFE
    SUP --> COVER
    HOST --> ORCHESTRATOR
    PROTOCOL -.规则与门禁.-> ORCHESTRATOR
    ORCHESTRATOR --> TASKS
    TASKS --> TARGET
    TARGET --> EVIDENCE
    EVIDENCE --> FINDING[Finding 候选]
    FINDING --> VERIFY[复现 · 独立 Oracle<br/>负对照 · 根因确认]
    VERIFY --> LIFE
    LIFE --> REPORT[测试报告与导出]
    COVER --> REPORT

    subgraph KNOWLEDGE[经验与质量]
        LESSONS[项目 / 全局 SQLite 错题集]
        REPLAY[回放与质量评估]
    end

    LESSONS --> PROTOCOL
    REPLAY --> LESSONS

    classDef user fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef control fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,color:#7c2d12,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef exec fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef result fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#4c1d95,stroke-width:2px;
    class USER user;
    class CLI,HOST,PROTOCOL,SUP,LIFE,COVER,ORCHESTRATOR control;
    class TASKS,TARGET,EVIDENCE,LESSONS,REPLAY exec;
    class FINDING,VERIFY,REPORT result;
